{"title":"Career Roadmap · Set Designer","role":"Set Designer","summary":"A Set Designer creates the visual and physical environment for films, television, theatre, advertising, events, music videos, photography and immersive experiences. The role combines spatial design, architecture, storytelling, visual composition, materials, construction knowledge and production planning.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Set Designer creates the visual and physical environment for films, television, theatre, advertising, events, music videos, photography and immersive experiences. The role combines spatial design, architecture, storytelling, visual composition, materials, construction knowledge and production planning."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Des graduate, the strongest route is to build capability across concept development + spatial design + 3D visualisation + technical drawings + production execution."},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des Spatial/Exhibition Design","Set Design Internship/Assistantship","Assistant Set Designer","Set Designer","Senior Set Designer / Production Designer","Art Director / Production Designer"],"label":"Typical route"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Timeline","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Spatial design, drawing, visual storytelling"}],[{"text":"Skill Development"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"3D modelling, materials, technical drawings"}],[{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Film/theatre/advertising/event set design"}],[{"text":"Industry Preparation"},{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Portfolio, internships, production projects"}],[{"text":"Entry Level"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Set Design Assistant / Art Department Assistant"}],[{"text":"Developing"},{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":